        "pill_text": "Excessive Shedding",
        "title": "<h2>🚿 Sign #1: Your Shower Drain Clogs More Often</h2>",
        "text": "<p><strong>What's Happening:</strong> If you're pulling clumps of hair out of the drain every week (or even daily), that's not normal shedding. Most people lose 50-100 hairs a day, but when DHT levels spike, that number can double or triple.</p>",
        "text_2": "<p><strong>Why It's DHT:</strong> DHT attaches to your hair follicles and slowly shrinks them. The first sign? Excessive shedding. Your hair isn't just \"falling out\"—it's being pushed out by follicles that are literally suffocating.</p>"
      }
    },
    "cwc_listicle_image_text_DQdfAB": {
      "type": "CWC_listicle_image_text",
      "name": "Listicle Image Text",
      "settings": {
