        "image_position": false,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/lplist-male_hair_support_07-min.png",
        "pill_text": "Receding Hairline",
        "title": "<h2>👀 Sign #2: Your Hairline Is Creeping Back</h2>",
        "text": "<p><strong>What's Happening:</strong> You might not be \"bald\" yet, but you've noticed your forehead looks a bit bigger in photos. Or maybe your temples are forming that classic \"M\" shape. It starts subtle, but it's unmistakable once you see it.</p>",
        "text_2": "<p><strong>Why It's DHT:</strong> The follicles at your hairline and crown are the most sensitive to DHT. When DHT levels rise, these areas are the first to thin. It's not bad luck or genetics alone—it's a hormonal attack on your most vulnerable follicles.</p>"
      }
    },
    "cwc_listicle_image_text_Www933": {
