        "pill_text": "Hair Thinning",
        "title": "<h2>🪮 Sign #3: Your Hair Feels Thinner and Weaker</h2>",
        "text": "<p><strong>What's Happening:</strong> Your hair used to feel thick and full, but now it feels fine, almost fragile. When you run your fingers through it, there's less volume. It doesn't hold a style like it used to.</p>",
        "text_2": "<p><strong>Why It's DHT:</strong> DHT doesn't just cause hair loss—it causes \"miniaturization.\" Your follicles shrink, and the hair they produce gets thinner and weaker with each growth cycle.</p>"
      }
    },
