        "text": "<p><strong>What's Happening:</strong> You wake up and there are strands on your pillowcase. Not just one or two—enough that you notice it every single morning. It's becoming part of your routine, and it's unsettling.</p><p><a href=\"/products/simply®-dht-blocker\" title=\"Natural DHT Blocker\">See How Men Are Fighting Hair Loss Naturally </a></p>",
        "text_2": "<p><strong>Why It's DHT:</strong> Hair that's affected by DHT has a shorter growth cycle. It falls out faster and grows back weaker (if at all). The pillow test is one of the earliest warning signs.</p>"
      }
