        "text": "<p><strong>What's Happening:</strong> Hair loss used to be an \"old man\" problem, but now guys in their 20s and 30s are dealing with it. If you're noticing thinning earlier than your dad did, something's off.</p><p><a href=\"/products/simply®-dht-blocker\" title=\"Natural DHT Blocker\">Find Out How to Balance DHT Naturally</a></p>",
        "text_2": "<p><strong>Why It's DHT:</strong> Modern factors—stress, diet, environmental toxins—can cause DHT levels to spike earlier in life. Your body is producing too much of this hormone too soon.</p>"
      }
